              }
            },
            {
              "id": "kql_unknown_operator",
              "name": "KqlUnknownOperator",
              "helpUri": "https://opentide.org/docs/cli/diagnostics#kql_unknown_operator",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "The KQL tabular operator is not one Kusto knows."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The KQL tabular operator is not one Kusto knows."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "kql_unknown_operator\n\nThe KQL tabular operator is not one Kusto knows.\n\nReported by the analysis engine in a KQL query, at the place in the query: as an error, a query the platform would reject, by opentide validate (its queries check) and opentide validate query; as a warning or a note, style, by opentide lint (its queries check). An editor running opentide lsp start shows both.\n\nExample\n\nopentide validate query\n\nHow to fix\n\nChange the query where the frame points, then run opentide validate query (--file for one rule or query file) or opentide lint --check queries again. The KQL reference (https://learn.microsoft.com/kusto/query/) describes the syntax and the commands the engine checks against.",
                "markdown": "# kql_unknown_operator\n\nThe KQL tabular operator is not one Kusto knows.\n\nReported by the analysis engine in a KQL query, at the place in the query: as an error, a query the platform would reject, by `opentide validate` (its `queries` check) and `opentide validate query`; as a warning or a note, style, by `opentide lint` (its `queries` check). An editor running `opentide lsp start` shows both.\n\n## Example\n\n```text\nopentide validate query\n```\n\n## How to fix\n\nChange the query where the frame points, then run `opentide validate query` (`--file` for one rule or query file) or `opentide lint --check queries` again. The [KQL reference](https://learn.microsoft.com/kusto/query/) describes the syntax and the commands the engine checks against.\n"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "kql_unknown_table",
              "name": "KqlUnknownTable",
              "helpUri": "https://opentide.org/docs/cli/diagnostics#kql_unknown_table",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "The table is neither one the engine knows for the platform nor one the workspace declares in visibility.toml: a warning under Sentinel, whose workspaces hold tables no catalog lists; an error under Defender's advanced hunting schema. Declaring it in visibility.toml makes it known."
              },
