            },
            {
              "id": "sysdig_definition_duplicate",
              "name": "SysdigDefinitionDuplicate",
              "helpUri": "https://opentide.org/docs/cli/diagnostics#sysdig_definition_duplicate",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "A name is defined more than once across the block's macros and lists."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A name is defined more than once across the block's macros and lists."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "sysdig_definition_duplicate\n\nA name is defined more than once across the block's macros and lists.\n\nReported by the analysis engine for an object file: an editor running opentide lsp start shows it. opentide validate and opentide lint are the authority for objects and name the same problem with their own code.\n\nExample\n\nopentide validate\n\nHow to fix\n\nChange the file where the frame points, then run opentide validate again.",
                "markdown": "# sysdig_definition_duplicate\n\nA name is defined more than once across the block's macros and lists.\n\nReported by the analysis engine for an object file: an editor running `opentide lsp start` shows it. `opentide validate` and `opentide lint` are the authority for objects and name the same problem with their own code.\n\n## Example\n\n```text\nopentide validate\n```\n\n## How to fix\n\nChange the file where the frame points, then run `opentide validate` again.\n"
              }
